  <p id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001:m0000" ref="d84_kqu_2g5">何尚之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001:m0004" ref="d84_kqu_2g5">彥德</persName>，廬江灊人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001:m0015" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2">準</persName>，高尚不應徵辟。祖<persName id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001:m0025" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_D">惔</persName>，南康太守。父<persName id="c-songshu-066-heshangzhi-uncle-line:p001:m0033" ref="3ea_uzt_2n2_DA">叔度</persName></p>
